<%- include('partials/head') %>
<%- include('partials/header') %>

<div class="container container-mid">
  <%- include('partials/flash') %>
  <h1>Chuyen ten mien ve</h1>
  <p class="muted">Chuyen ten mien dang o nha dang ky khac ve quan ly tai day. Thoi han su dung con lai duoc giu nguyen va cong them thoi gian ban mua.</p>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-title"><h2>Thong tin ten mien</h2></div>
    <form method="post" action="/gio-hang/them">
      <input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>">
      <input type="hidden" name="action" value="transfer">

      <div class="field">
        <label for="domain"><span class="field-name">Ten mien can chuyen</span>
        <input id="domain" type="text" name="domain" value="<%= values.domain || '' %>" placeholder="tenmien-cua-ban.com" required autofocus>
      </div>

      <div class="field">
        <label for="auth_code"><span class="field-name">Ma xac thuc (EPP / Auth Code)</span>
        <input id="auth_code" type="text" name="auth_code" class="mono" required></label>
        <div class="hint">Lay tai trang quan ly cua nha dang ky <strong>hien tai</strong>. Moi noi goi mot ten: EPP Code, Auth Code, Transfer Key hoac Ma chuyen doi.</div>
      </div>

      <div class="field" style="max-width:200px">
        <label for="years"><span class="field-name">Gia han them</span>
        <select id="years" name="years"></label>
          <% for (var y = 1; y <= 10; y++) { %><option value="<%= y %>"><%= y %> nam</option><% } %>
        </select></label>
      </div>

      <button class="btn btn-lg" type="submit">Them vao gio hang</button>
    </form>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="card-title"><h2>Truoc khi chuyen, kiem tra 4 dieu</h2></div>
    <ol class="stack" style="padding-left:20px; margin:0">
      <li><strong>Da qua 60 ngay</strong> ke tu lan dang ky moi hoac lan chuyen gan nhat. Day la quy dinh chung cua ICANN, khong nha dang ky nao bo qua duoc.</li>
      <li><strong>Ten mien khong bi khoa.</strong> Trang thai <code>clientTransferProhibited</code> phai duoc go tai nha dang ky cu.</li>
      <li><strong>Email quan tri ten mien con truy cap duoc.</strong> Thu xac nhan se gui vao email dang ky trong WHOIS - khong duyet thi yeu cau tu huy sau 5-7 ngay.</li>
      <li><strong>Ten mien con han it nhat vai ngay.</strong> Ten mien sap het han nen gia han truoc roi hay chuyen.</li>
    </ol>
    <p class="tiny muted" style="margin:14px 0 0">Ten mien quoc te thuong mat 5-7 ngay de hoan tat. Ten mien .vn theo qui trinh rieng cua VNNIC.</p>
  </div>

  <% if (tlds.length) { %>
    <div class="card">
      <div class="card-title"><h2>Phi chuyen ve</h2></div>
      <div class="table-wrap">
        <table>
          <thead><tr><th>Duoi</th><th class="right">Phi chuyen ve</th><th>Bao gom</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <% tlds.forEach(function (t) { %>
              <tr>
                <td><strong>.<%= t.tld %></strong></td>
                <td class="right"><strong><%= formatVnd(priceFor(t, 'transfer', 1).total) %></strong></td>
                <td class="small muted">Cong them 1 nam su dung</td>
              </tr>
            <% }); %>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </div>
  <% } else { %>
    <div class="alert alert-info">Hien chua co duoi ten mien nao mo dich vu chuyen ve. Vui long lien he de duoc ho tro.</div>
  <% } %>
</div>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
